  "description": "The generation-unit register (SOM §11.2): specGenerationUnits reads the units a document declares in its register (here DEMO/DLV-LST of the shared model), in register order, each with its trimmed mappings and emitters; a unit without a unitId and a second unit of an id already seen are left out, and so are a mapping without an area and an emitter without an id. mappingFor gives the first mapping of an area or null; specDefaultUnits the units whose mappings hold an area, in register order. sectionUnits is a section's units override as stored (units(path)), null when unset. standardEmitters is K_SPEC_STANDARD_EMITTERS in order. Every runtime runs every case; areas lists the area codes mappingFor and defaultUnits are asked for.",
